    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Retrieval API allows users to access and view saved cart items for their shopping experience. This endpoint retrieves the current state of the user's shopping cart, including product details, quantities, and prices. It is particularly useful for customers who want to review their selections before finalizing a purchase. Typically, this API is utilized by frontend applications and e-commerce platforms to enhance user engagement and streamline the check-out process.",
